{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Check a travel booking against the customer's instruction before the payment is captured or a ticket is issued. Call this before paying or ticketing: pass the customer's booking mandate (travelers, route, dates, cabin, fare terms, price limit) \u2014 or the id of a mandate already created \u2014 and the booking you built. ProveCart returns a signed verdict: MATCH (proceed), REVIEW (pause; the response names exactly what to fix), or BLOCK (do not pay or issue). Every check leaves a sealed evidence record; ProveCart never holds or moves money. Non-MATCH responses follow the Agent Correction Format (ACF): a machine-readable corrections array (dimension, action, expected, actual, reason), a retry budget, and a sealed evidence pointer (spec: https://provecart.com/standards/correction-format). Requires an integrator API key in the X-API-Key header.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"BookingEndpointIn":{"properties":{"airport":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Airport"},"city":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"City"}},"title":"BookingEndpointIn","type":"object"},"BookingFareIn":{"properties":{"cabin":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Cabin"},"change_fee":{"anyOf":[{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Change Fee"},"fare_class":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Fare Class"},"refundability":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Refundability"}},"title":"BookingFareIn","type":"object"},"BookingLegIn":{"properties":{"arrive_at":{"title":"Arrive At","type":"string"},"carrier":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Carrier"},"depart_at":{"title":"Depart At","type":"string"},"flight_number":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Fli